From 0f82d0ea9e113c51faa65f6e2521a6ca6da28553 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 15:12:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix XSS gap, HTTP source, docs, CI pins; trim squad table;
 add tests
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Escape sh.result (not just sh.player) in the shot-map tooltip builder,
  closing an inconsistent-escaping gap with untrusted Understat data.
- Fetch ClubElo ratings over https instead of http.
- Remove README's dangling reference to a nonexistent DESIGN.md.
- Restore GitHub Actions to their previously-newer versions (checkout@v5,
  setup-python@v6, upload-pages-artifact@v4, deploy-pages@v5).
- Add .gitignore for generated data/ and site/ output.
- Cap requirements.txt to avoid unreviewed major-version bumps on scheduled
  CI runs; add requirements-dev.txt + pytest coverage for the pure helper
  functions in ingest.py and build.py.
- Remove the £m, Pts, Form and Sel% columns from the Squad table.
---
